# Peeker

@origami-3@PDF@ @capsule-5@Peeker@ is a PDF editor that runs entirely in your browser, so your files are never uploaded. It uses the open-source pdf.js and pdf-lib libraries!

[Open Peeker](/peeker) · [Phone version](/peeker/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Peeker|purple}
## What you can do

* @comic-4@Mark up@: add text, highlights, drawings, boxes, whiteout, pictures and signatures!
* ++GL;Pages++: rotate, reorder, duplicate and delete pages, and merge PDFs!
* ++G/:Forms++: fill in form fields!
* !!<]G#Search# the text of a PDF!
* Edit (E): the Edit tool turns the text and pictures already in a PDF into marks you can move, change or replace!

## Privacy

Peeker reads and edits the PDF inside your browser. Nothing is sent to a server, so it is safe for private paperwork!
